For EACH of the four REQ-S2 forgery tests, the forgery was temporarily
re-introduced (sabotage), the corresponding test turned RED, then the tree
was reverted. Clean-tree reruns are green (see S1 acceptance below).

## S1a — spoofed --source ignored
- Sabotage: `scripts/send_identity.py` attested return changed to
